Bind Npc 31402 Zone 21

On topics
    Topic "Chatting" goto chatting
    Topic "Accessories combination ask" goto asking
    Topic "Assemble" goto start
    Topic "Assemble View" goto recipes

On chatting
    Say "Hi, they call me jewel. Why am I here you ask? It's a bit of a long story ... but I will tell you, <selfname>. I have been taught to craft magical jewelry as a part of my family's business, but greed has corrupted my family and I ran away. I travelled around the world before ending up here in Moradon. Now I use my jeweling skills here to combine old accessories to help people. My skills have yet to be perfected, but sometimes I get lucky!"
    Topic "Previous Page" goto greeting

On asking
    Say "Combining three old accessories into a new accessory is the greatest skill a jewel crafter can possess. These old accessories now can have a new life and make their owner feel reborn in the process! Oh how wonderful! Bring me 3 identical Old Accesory, Nest Scrap (5), Scrap of Steel (50) and Soft Stone (1), and I will make you a new accessory. Be aware that my skills are not perfected yet, so I cannot guarantee results. I have a higher probability to fail than succeed. Haha!"
    Topic "Previous Page" goto greeting

On start
    Say "Are you going to start production? Finally! Let's do it~"
    Topic "Yes, I ask" goto combine
    Topic "No, I will come back later" goto close

On combine
    Open item combine panel

On recipes
    Open combine recipe book
